---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Privacy | EduLearnLabs" description="EduLearnLabs collects no data from children. Progress is saved only on your device."
  path="privacy/" nav="privacy">
  <Breadcrumbs back={{ name: 'Home', path: '' }} items={[{ name: 'Home', path: '' }, { name: 'Privacy', path: 'privacy/' }]} />
  <section class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy, in plain words</h1>
    <p><strong>We do not collect any information about children.</strong> There are no accounts, no names, no email
      addresses, no photos and no chat.</p>
    <h2>What is saved, and where</h2>
    <p>To remember stars and progress, the games save a small note in your browser's local storage on this device.
      It contains each player's animal and color, and which games were played with how many right answers.
      It never leaves your device and we cannot see it. You can remove it any time on the
      <a href={url('grown-ups/')}>Grown-ups page</a>, or by clearing your browser's site data.</p>
    <h2>What we do not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No cookies for tracking, and no advertising inside games.</li>
      <li>No analytics on children and no profiles of children.</li>
      <li>No links inside games that leave the game.</li>
      <li>No in-game purchases.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The site is served by GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may keep standard technical logs, such as IP
      addresses, to run and protect the service. We do not receive or use these to identify anyone.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we ever add ads to the website (never inside games), they will be non-personalized and child-safe, and we will
      update this page first. Questions? Contact {SITE.maker} through <a href={SITE.makerUrl}>{SITE.makerUrl.replace('https://', '')}</a>.</p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: 11 November 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
